  "findings": [
    "The original source conference's unaccepted Companion04 dependency is historical. Current companion-life10 exact05 was applied among the72 and must be supplied with exact acceptance/application/holds. This does not automatically grant its profiles to Colossus or Finger of Death.",
    "Summon Bone Colossus must preserve140baseHP, two slams and cleave. It needs a complete new actual body/combat profile and explicit command alternatives. Finger of Death needs a separate complete zombie/body-consumption/lifetime profile. A generic minion name is not evidence; a newly killed body cannot simultaneously fund Finger's rider and Auto-Raise or harvest.",
    "Black Reaping preserves6d8 and aggregate healing. Define whether its qualifying final branches include actual transferred damage, excluding duplicate parent sums, prevention and overkill. Null does not automatically erase actual damage but can prevent death-based riders. Resolve all actual deaths before treating a later heal as eligible; no resurrection follows from an aggregate heal.",
    "Plague Wind has30ft cone/8d6 plus undefined ongoing effects, not an adopted general disease engine. Pending Contagion is not authority. Separate immunity to disease, necrotic damage, Poisoned and breathing. Use actual delivered treatments and finite clocks; the petrified oral-delivery issue found in Life5 applies whenever such a route is proposed.",
    "Metal to Glass's DEX save avoids dropping and does not avoid conversion. Worn armor, anchored supports, held tools and concealed containers need distinct whole-object eligibility and physical consequences. Native material conversion cannot create sale value, restore consumed metal or silently grant object-targeting attacks.",
    "Titanic Grip says YOUR size doubles, STR becomes22 and attacks gain2d6;120ft and Instantaneous metadata conflict with self/duration and need explicit choices. Fixed22 is not automatically minimum22. Flash Freeze has6d10 plus one-round Restrained; ice does not implicitly supply suffocation, cover or a second HP shell.",
    "Transmute Being must author all three Elemental/Beast/Ooze menus with complete real body/ability/equipment profiles. Regenerate is one4d8+15heal plus limb regrowth, with explicit independent-component and detached-part lineage. Body8 can supply its accepted exact scope and holds but cannot supply unspecified new form, regeneration or harvest rules.",
    "Minimum future evidence is two full cases per spell plus genuinely distinct branches, including all three Transmute Being forms. No current numerical examples exist to be promoted to accepted gameplay evidence. Preserve original sources and declare new choices, prerequisite fixtures and unavailable positive branches explicitly."
  ],
